## Summary

Implemented the complete native WinUI **data-display** component category for the TeslaSync Windows app (P2/W2-0003), with all logic in the headless `TeslaSync.App.Core` (unit-tested) and the controls in `TeslaSync.App/Components/DataDisplay/`.

**Delivered (all 40+ controls from the spec):**
