- **Cards/metrics** ΓÇö `TsStatCard, TsMetricCard, TsInlineMetric, TsMetricBar, TsAnimatedNumber, TsKVList, TsUsageCard, TsKpiOverviewCard, TsComparisonHeader, TsDelta`.
- **Status/freshness** ΓÇö `TsStatusBadge, TsSeverityBadge, TsStatusDot, TsFSMBadge, TsSourceLayerBadge, TsLiveIndicator, TsFreshnessIndicator, TsDataFreshness` (the 120s/600s two-minute contract).
- **Timeline/lists** ΓÇö `TsTimeline, TsTimelineItem, TsRecentActivityFeed, TsDateGroupedList`.
- **User/history/playback** ΓÇö `TsAvatar, TsUserCell, TsHistoryListRow, TsScoreBadge, TsBatteryDelta, TsRouteDisplay, TsPlaybackControls, TsPlaybackSpeedMenu, TsTimelineScrubber`.

